{"id": "hw_acl_022", "vendor": "huawei", "domain": "acl", "level": 1, "instruction": "创建基本 ACL 2001，拒绝来自主机 10.1.1.5 的流量。", "context": "华为 AR2200 路由器，当前处于用户视图。", "reference": ["system-view", "acl number 2001", "rule 5 deny source 10.1.1.5 0"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^system-view$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "进入系统视图"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^acl (number )?2001$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "创建基本 ACL"}, {"id": "c3", "pattern": "^rule( \\d+)? deny source 10\\.1\\.1\\.5 (0|0\\.0\\.0\\.0)$", "weight": 2.0, "desc": "拒绝规则；基本 ACL 不带协议关键字"}], "forbidden": ["\\bswitchport\\b", "^configure terminal$", "^show ", "\\bport-channel\\b", "^router (ospf|bgp|eigrp)\\b", "^ip route \\b", "^access-list "], "notes": "基本 ACL（2000-2999）语法里没有协议字段，写成 deny ip source 是高级 ACL 语法。"}
{"id": "hw_acl_023", "vendor": "huawei", "domain": "acl", "level": 2, "instruction": "创建高级 ACL 3000，拒绝源网段 192.168.1.0/24 访问 Telnet 服务（TCP 23 端口）。", "context": "华为 AR2200 路由器，当前处于用户视图。", "reference": ["system-view", "acl number 3000", "rule 5 deny tcp source 192.168.1.0 0.0.0.255 destination-port eq 23"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^system-view$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "进入系统视图"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^acl (number )?3000$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "创建高级 ACL"}, {"id": "c3", "pattern": "^rule( \\d+)? deny tcp source 192\\.168\\.1\\.0 0\\.0\\.0\\.255( destination any)? destination-port eq (23|telnet)$", "weight": 2.0, "desc": "拒绝规则；destination any 可省略，eq 23 与 eq telnet 等价"}], "forbidden": ["\\bswitchport\\b", "^configure terminal$", "^show ", "\\bport-channel\\b", "^router (ospf|bgp|eigrp)\\b", "^ip route \\b", "^access-list "], "notes": "显式写 destination any 是合法且更完整的写法，checkpoint 两种都接受。"}
